G      OverviewH

	The scale interface application will conform to the man machine 
        interface (MMI) of the ECCO+ software in the following ways:

            o	The screen will be 40 column black on white.
            o	There will be a title on line 1.
            o	There will be a title bar on line 2.
            o	There will be an error window on lines 23-25.
            o	There will be a white on black bar at line 15 showing 
                the Total price and weight for the current transaction.

	The top window area will show a menu of Class information with 
        prices.  These items will be selectable via the UP and DOWN arrows 
        and the ENTER key.

	The bottom window area will be used to show the currently selected 
        items,  their price and any additional services selected.

	The weight and total price will be visable at all times.

        The application screen will comply with the following:

